 his interests. Nate previously won a big video game tournament, earning money he plans to save.\n  - Catan: Nate played the strategy game Catan, where players build settlements and trade resources, after meeting new friends at a game convention.\n  - figure: Nate mentioned that Iron Man is his top pick and he has a figure of him. Joanna later asked Nate what made him get that figure.\n  - tart: Nate commented that Joanna's tart looks yummy, which Joanna had recommended previously.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie from her road-trip script, asked about the coolest on-set moment, and commented that her food looked yummy with nice colors and kick.\n  - purse: Joanna has a purse which Nate noticed had a Spiderman pin on it.\n  - sprinkles: Nate used sprinkles in homemade coconut ice cream, which changed the dessert's color.\n  - audience: Joanna advised Nate to watch other people's videos first to understand what his audience likes before posting his own.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1929,"context_chars":7617,"retrieval_duration":0.2784554958343506,"response_duration":3.5070114135742188,"total_duration":3.7854669094085693,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer states that Nate has had his turtles for about 7 months and 24 days, which does not match the gold answer of three years.","completeness_grade":"INSUFFICIENT","completeness_reasoning":"The context does not provide any specific information regarding how long Nate has had his first two turtles. While it mentions that Nate has turtles and acquired another one, it does not specify the duration of ownership for the first two turtles. Therefore, the critical information needed to answer the question is absent.","missing_elements":["Duration of time Nate has had his first two turtles","Specific acquisition dates for the first two turtles"],"present_elements":["Nate has liked turtles since he was a boy","Nate has turtles","Nate acquired another turtle","Nate is showing his cute turtles","Nate took his turtles for a walk today","Nate loves turtles","Nate finds happiness watching his turtles","Nate's turtles bring him peace"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_8","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_8_qa_29","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"Who did Evan meet on his trip to Canada, and who did he come back from Canada with?","golden_answer":"Evan met the woman he fell in love with and returned with her.","hypothesis":"Evan met a Canadian woman during his trip to Canada on July 31, 2023. He returned from Canada on August 13, 2023, with his new significant other (SO), who is the same Canadian woman he met during the trip.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Evan met a Canadian woman during his trip to Canada. (event_time: 2023-07-31T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan recently returned from a vacation in Canada. (event_time: 2023-08-13T16:09:00Z)\n  - Evan went on a trip to Canada last week. (event_time: 2023-07-31T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan's SO visited Canada during the recent vacation. (event_time: 2023-08-13T16:09:00Z)\n  - The woman Evan met is Canadian. (event_time: 2023-07-31T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan acaba de regresar de un viaje con su familia. (event_time: 2023-05-18T13:47:00Z)\n  - Evan took a road trip with his family to Jasper (event_time: 2023-05-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan took a road trip to Jasper (event_time: 2023-05-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Canada is the destination for Evan's honeymoon trip. (event_time: 2024-02-06T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan took a road trip last mo