s creation.\n  - John: John empathized with James about losing power during a game. John stated a seminar he led went well, featuring a great turnout and knowledge sharing.\n  - John: John met three new friends in his programming course last Tuesday and expressed a dream of visiting Italy, while congratulating James on adopting a pup named Ned.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2075,"context_chars":8308,"retrieval_duration":0.18964028358459473,"response_duration":2.7530384063720703,"total_duration":2.942678689956665,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer correctly identifies the game John is hooked on, which is FIFA 23, and also includes the specific date mentioned in the question.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides clear and direct information that John is hooked on playing FIFA 23 on November 5, 2022. This matches the golden answer exactly, confirming that all necessary details to answer the question are present.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["John is currently hooked on the game FIFA 23","event_time: 2022-11-05T17:20:00Z"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_5","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_5_qa_45","category":"2","difficulty":"unknown","query":"How many pets will Andrew have, as of December 2023?","golden_answer":"three","hypothesis":"As of December 2023, Andrew will have three pets. He currently has two dogs, and he recently adopted a new puppy named Toby on November 22, 2023. Therefore, the total number of pets Andrew has is two dogs plus one new puppy, totaling three pets.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories 