ndy pieces.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2131,"context_chars":8709,"retrieval_duration":0.164473295211792,"response_duration":3.8789095878601074,"total_duration":4.043382883071899,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer captures the essence of Gina's motivation to start her own clothing store, mentioning both her job loss and her desire for a fulfilling career, which aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question about why Gina decided to start her own clothing store. It mentions that she lost her job, which prompted her to take control of her own destiny and start her own business. Additionally, it highlights her passion for fashion trends and finding unique pieces, which aligns with her motivation to open a clothing store. Therefore, all key elements from the golden answer are present and detailed enough to construct a complete answer.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Gina lost her job","Gina wanted to take control of her own destiny","Gina always loved fashion trends","Gina finding unique pieces","Gina decided to start her own business"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_9","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_9_qa_100","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"Where did Calvin and Frank Ocean record a song together?","golden_answer":"In the studio at Calvin's mansion","hypothesis":"Calvin and Frank Ocean recorded a song together at Calvin's mansion.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time th