ure is what he needs. Both individuals agree that being outdoors has a rejuvenating effect, highlighting the importance of nature in their overall mental health and well-being.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Evan finds nature to be peaceful, calming, and fun. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Sam shares the sentiment with Evan that being in nature is calming. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Nature acts like a reset button for Evan's mind and body. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Evan encourages Sam to enjoy time in nature. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Nature brings peace to Evan. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Nature had a relaxing effect on Evan. (event_time: 2023-07-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan considers nature a great experience. (event_time: 2023-12-31T11:00:00Z)\n  - Sam enjoys being surrounded by nature because it is tranquil and refreshing. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Sam thinks that being in nature is calming. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Evan aims to convey the peacefulness of being outdoors in his paintings. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Evan asked Sam if they enjoy exploring nature. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Evan advises finding joy in small moments outdoors. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Sam feels that connecting with nature is what they need. (event_time: 2023-10-17T13:50:00Z)\n  - Sam agrees that being outdoors has a rejuvenating effect. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Evan asked Sa