rcise calming. (event_time: 2023-03-13T11:22:00Z)\n  - Art provides solace for Deborah. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - Deborah likes to visit the spot by the water near her mother's old house to reflect and find peace. (event_time: 2023-02-04T09:48:00Z)\n  - Deborah is trying to channel her grief by spending more time with family. (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Deborah is channeling her grief. (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Deborah seeks to hang out with like-minded people and find peace and understanding at the yoga retreat. (event_time: 2023-06-26T09:17:00Z)\n  - A pet brings comfort to Deborah. (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Artwork reminds Deborah of those she has lost. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - The dahlias bring peace to Deborah. (event_time: 2023-02-22T16:12:00Z)\n  - Jolene inquired about how Deborah is managing after the loss. (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Deborah feels peace when sitting in a specific spot by the window at the mother's old house (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Jolene is glad that Deborah has a location to relax and find peace. (event_time: 2023-08-30T11:46:00Z)\n  - Deborah asked about the experience of Jolene finding her, imagining the relief felt by Jolene. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah gets happiness from giving people peace and awareness. (event_time: 2023-03-13T11:22:00Z)\n  - Deborah's photo serves as a reminder to find peace even in chaos. (event_time: 2023-02-25T16:50:00Z)\n  - Deborah feels peace and gratitude when she goes back to this spot. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah is passionate about helping people find peace and joy through yoga. (event_time: 2023-01-23T16:06:00Z)\n  - The place of peace can provide relaxation for Deborah. (event_time: 2023-08-30T11:46:00Z)\n  - Deborah's activity aims to help individuals find inner peace (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah found comfort in her work after the setback. (event_