, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Audrey believes it is important to teach pets using positive reinforcement. (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey is using positive reinforcement techniques to address the dogs' issues. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey (assistant)'s pups are still responding positively to positive reinforcement. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey believes that pets like rewards (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey thinks that pets are quick learners (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey is currently participating in a dog training course. (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:32:00Z)\n  - Audrey provides training as an activity for her four pups. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Audrey wants her pets to feel seen and loved. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Audrey intends to strengthen her bond with her pets through the workshop. (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey believes that helping animals is great. (event_time: 2023-07-27T15:52:00Z)\n  - Audrey's pets make Audrey happy. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Audrey's dogs are showing improvement due to the dog training course. (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:32:00Z)\n  - Audrey thinks punishment is never the proper way to interact with pets. (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey has pets. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Audrey's four pups love training. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - The dog training course has been a big time sink for Audrey's dogs. (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:32:00Z)\n  - Audrey works on obedience training. (event_time: 2023-09-24T17:53:00Z)\n  - Audrey agrees that animals have a way of brightening our day and giving us lots of love and joy. (event_time: 2023-07-27T15:52:00Z)\n  - Audrey considers pets to be like family to people. (event_time: 2023-06-26T13:51:00Z)\n  - The positive reinforcement training class is something that must be learned by dog ow