 a source of strength for him, helping him stay focused and motivated, as mentioned on November 2, 2023.\n\n5. **Staying Informed**: Keeping up with world events also motivates him regarding his music, as noted on October 23, 2023.\n\n6. **Collaborating with Others**: Working with others and sharing his story provides him with motivation and inspiration, as indicated on September 13, 2023.\n\nThese strategies collectively help Calvin maintain his motivation and continue striving towards his goals despite setbacks.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Calvin seeing something every day keeps Calvin motivated and reminds Calvin to keep pushing. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Calvin reminds himself about why Calvin is passionate about Calvin's goals when setbacks occur. (event_time: 2023-10-15T09:39:00Z)\n  - Calvin is motivated by surrounding himself with passion. (event_time: 2023-07-21T18:38:00Z)\n  - Calvin is motivated by Dave's enthusiasm. (event_time: 2023-08-14T00:35:00Z)\n  - Calvin is motivated by sharing his story. (event_time: 2023-09-13T10:56:00Z)\n  - Calvin is motivated by collaborating with others. (event_time: 2023-07-21T18:38:00Z)\n  - Moments motivate Calvin to keep growing (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - The music is a source of strength for Calvin to keep going. (event_time: 2023-09-13T10:56:00Z)\n  - Calvin is striving onwards to goals. (event_time: 2023-10-04T14:44:00Z)\n  - Supportive people motivate Calvin to stay true to himself as an artist (event_time: 2023-11-1