imal behaviorist to better understand her dogs. This appointment was made on October 25, 2023, and she received tips to help with her dogs' problems on October 28, 2023. Additionally, on November 4, 2023, Andrew asked Audrey for tips on being a multi-dog pet owner, indicating that she was actively sharing her knowledge and experiences related to dog care during that time.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Audrey spent most of her free time taking care of her four dogs and ensuring they are happy and healthy. (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey sought help from an animal behaviorist to better understand her dogs. (event_time: 2023-10-25T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey feels closer to her pups because she is taking care of their grooming (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey started taking care of the grooming of her pups herself (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey takes her dogs for a walk. (event_time: 2023-04-16T16:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey plans to take dogs hiking. (event_time: 2023-07-08T09:48:00Z)\n  - Andrew asked Audrey what actions she will take to help with the problems related to Audrey's dogs. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey is spending time with her pets (event_time: 2023-05-03T17:41:00Z)\n  - The animal behaviorist gave Audrey tips to help with her dogs' problems (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey is busy taking care of her pets (event_time: 2023-05-03T17:41:00Z)\n  - Audrey wants to take her pups for a stroll at the gorgeous spot. (event_time: