erest in writing conventions after Nate mentioned attending a game convention, suggesting she might look into attending one.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2032,"context_chars":8438,"retrieval_duration":0.14569425582885742,"response_duration":2.1341495513916016,"total_duration":2.279843807220459,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer accurately reflects Joanna's plans to submit her screenplay to film festivals and seek attention from producers and directors, which aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question about Joanna's plans for her finished screenplay in January 2022. It explicitly states that Joanna plans to submit her screenplay to film festivals and intends for producers and directors to check it out, which aligns perfectly with the golden answer.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["submit it to film festivals","get producers and directors to check it out"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_0","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_0_qa_36","category":"2","difficulty":"unknown","query":"When did Caroline join a mentorship program?","golden_answer":"The weekend before 17 July 2023","hypothesis":"Caroline joined a mentorship program for LGBTQ youth on July 15, 2023.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Caroline joined a mentorship program for LGBTQ youth last weekend. (event_time: 2023-07-15T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline finds joining the mentorsh