 to express herself (event_time: 2023-08-14T14:24:00Z)\n  - Caroline's self-portrait is an example of her art (event_time: 2023-08-16T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline works as an artist. (event_time: 2023-08-14T14:24:00Z)\n  - Caroline saw someone drawing on the ground the other day. (event_time: 2023-08-25T13:33:00Z)\n  - Caroline considers painting to be therapeutic (event_time: 2023-08-23T15:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline is inspired to keep making art. (event_time: 2023-09-13T00:09:00Z)\n  - Caroline has found her true self. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline puts her feelings on the canvas when creating abstract art. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline painted the painting after visiting the beach last week. (event_time: 2023-08-18T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline stated that what she drew signifies being real and embracing her womanhood (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Melanie asked Caroline if Caroline drew entity 2. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline aimed to show warmth, love, and self-acceptance through the painting. (event_time: 2023-08-14T14:24:00Z)\n  - Caroline finds painting great for self-expression (event_time: 2023-08-23T15:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline has recently been trying out abstract stuff. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline's finding of self-acceptance was a long process. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline learned self-acceptance from the experience. (event_time: 2023-07-12T16:33:00Z)\n  - Caroline finds abstract stuff to be a cool form of self-expression. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline's art shows her story (event_time: 2023-08-14T14:24:00Z)\n  - Having the courage to transition enabled Caroline's authentic self-expression. (event_time: 2023-07-15T13:51:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - self-portrait: Caroline created a recent self-portrait last week, noting that painting is great for self-expression.\n  - tra